+/* TSP_SHCACHE_V1 -------------------------------------------------------------
+   ConvertShader + the two TSP rewrites cost ~19 ms per shader of pure CPU and
+   are a deterministic function of the raw source, so the result is cacheable.
+   The program-binary cache removes the ~50 ms link; this removes the larger
+   remaining half (~38 ms per program pair).
